S627 UNIT-DISTANCE H-GAP CARRIER REFRAMING
===========================================

Thesis: the meaningful H=7/H=21 relation is not a literal unit-distance tournament with 7 or 21 Hamiltonian paths.  It is a forbidden-collapse test: raw unit-edge counts may hit 7 or 21 only after their spine/tile/frontier carriers have been forgotten.

